*.exe
*.png
*.pptx
cmd/debug_*/
# ...except this one, which is tracked on purpose: it is the harness the renderer
# is accepted against. It renders a deck and then interrogates the model, the
# package XML and the rendered pixels, which is how a fidelity bug gets
# attributed instead of guessed at.
# The directory is re-included rather than the files inside it: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so a rule such as
# "!cmd/debug_preview/*.go" would silently do nothing.
!cmd/debug_preview/
# Internal agent notes and render byproducts — local to this machine, never published.
.workbuddy/
out_deck/

# Golden images for the rendering regression tests are deliberately tracked.
!testdata/render/*.png
# ...but freshly rendered output that failed a golden comparison is not.
testdata/render/*.actual.png
